3:T42f,Most sales tools automate tasks. Ava owns the entire BDR job. She finds best-fit leads from a database of over 250 million B2B professionals across over 200 countries, plus Artisan Local Data with over 250 million local businesses, using intent signals like funding rounds, leadership hires, and website visits, then enriches them with verified emails and AI web research. She runs personalized campaigns across email and social outreach, continuously testing dozens of message variations and shifting volume toward what converts. Calling is built into the platform too: Ava auto-triggers call steps on engagement and dials them, then a rep takes the live conversation. She handles every reply against a knowledge base and books qualified meetings directly on reps' calendars. Ava Inbound extends the same platform to your website: live chat that greets and qualifies visitors, answers from the same knowledge base, and books meetings with CRM-owner routing, so inbound and outbound run on the same platform. Inbound and outbound both run on the same usage-based pricing.0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"id":"article-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\\u002Ftargeted-lead-generation#article\",\"headline\":\"A complete guide to successful targeted lead generation\",\"name\":\"A complete guide to successful targeted lead generation\",\"description\":\"Learn how to run targeted lead generation campaigns to speed up your sales cycle and close more deals in this comprehensive guide. \",\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.ctfassets.net\\u002Fkyprwggh4muz\\u002F1xkyHsd0KLSxKdldEnHxep\\u002F25d2e8393e3778492962a0e3db290f59\\u002FCOVER.webp\"],\"datePublished\":\"2025-02-26\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-02-26\",\"author\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Faut