ollowers match your target buyer personas and have purchasing power, rather than large follower counts.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Look for industry expertise:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Choose partners with proven technical knowledge and credibility in your specific market space over general business influencers.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Evaluate engagement quality:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Look for partners whose content sparks meaningful discussions and attracts an audience that actively seeks their recommendations.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Keep in mind that those with smaller audiences, often called micro-influencers, tend to be more affordable. A lower follower count isnâ€™t necessarily a bad thing, especially if a high percentage of the followers are all interested in one specific area that you can help them with.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"7. Retarget Website Visitors With Personalized Ads","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A lot of your website visitors leave your site without buying anything. To ensure they donâ€™t forget about you, use retargeting ads. Retargeting tools track visitor IP addresses. This enables you to run advertisements based on leadsâ€™ previous interactions with your brand.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For example, a lead who recently visited your websiteâ€™s homepage might see an ad for a free ultimate guide for solving a problem related to your business.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Â Meanwhile, a lead who just downloaded a recorded demo of your product would see a more bottom-of-the-funnel piece, such as a Facebook ad for a case study.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI tools come in handy here, with ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://ss-usa.s3.amazonaws.com/c/308479174/media/1976608ad1775f05e65471030286424/SharpSpring%20Ads%20-%20Outlook%20on%20Regargeting.pdf"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"88% of marketers","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" stating that they are either currently or planning to use AI for retargeting.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"8. Referrals and Word-of-Mouth Marketing","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Word-of-mouth is one of the oldest and most effective ways to generate new B2B leads for your business.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But, aside from winning new business, thereâ€™s another reason to institute referral marketing: referral contagion.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"According to research done by the ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1177/00222437241257886"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"American Marketing Association","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", referred customers make anywhere from 31-57% more referrals than non-referred customers.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Itâ€™s as if theyâ€™re so appreciative that someone introduced them to your awesome company that they want to pass on the good deed, like the people in those heartwarming â€œacts of kindnessâ€ Coca-Cola commercials.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Here are some tips for building a referral marketing strategy:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Build a structured referral program with clear incentives:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Create a formal system that rewards clients for successful referrals through service credits, freebies, and discounts. Referral marketing tools like ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://referral-factory.com/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Referral Factory","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" make it easy to set these up.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Create valuable, shareable content:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" To build brand awareness, develop articles and industry reports that your customers will want to share with their professional network. Itâ€™s even better if sharing the material should make the client appear smart among their peers.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Use LinkedIn for personal referral outreach: ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Regularly search through existing clients' networks on LinkedIn for second-degree connections that match your ICP. Create InMail templates to ask clients for warm introductions through the platform.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Ask at the right time: ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pick specific points in the customer journey to ask for referrals. That might be after successful project milestones or positive quarterly reviews. Train your customer success and sales team to identify and act on these moments.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Afraid to ask for referrals?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Thatâ€™s common.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But thereâ€™s no need to be.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Clients who find value in your solution will want to help you out. More than that, theyâ€™ll want the brownie points from their happy peers who are loving their recommendation.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"9. Cold Calling","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"How many times have you heard that â€œcold calling is deadâ€?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Well, itâ€™s not.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The phone is still an extremely effective strategy for booking meetings with your targeted leads, building rapport, and speeding up the sales cycle.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"co